### Manual auth smoke test
### File temporar pentru verificare rapida. Il putem sterge dupa testare.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Auth Test User",
  "email": "auth-test@example.com",
  "password": "parola123"
}

### 2. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "auth-test@example.com",
  "password": "parola123"
}

### Dupa login:
### 1. copiaza tokenul din raspuns
### 2. pune-l mai jos la @token
@token = PASTE_JWT_HERE

### 3. Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Admin-only users list
### Pentru un user normal ar trebui sa raspunda cu 403 Forbidden.
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
